  "meta": {
    "schema": "suborno.ui-audit-checkmap/1.0",
    "purpose": "Maps every Invoke-SubornoUiAudit.ps1 check_id onto the traceability-matrix test_id(s) in docs/reports/UI_FUNCTIONAL_AUDIT_TRACEABILITY_MATRIX.csv. Consumed by scripts/layout_verify/merge_audit_results.py. A check id may target several matrix rows (one element row + its toggle/options/set variants share the row). Failure-path-only ids (ABT-open, OSK-open, DD-*-select, SET-SAVE-invoke, SET-CANCEL-invoke) are included so a partial Windows run still reconciles.",
    "note": "Unmapped matrix rows (OSK-DRAG/REFRESH/DPI, TOP-DRAG/CTX/IDLE, TRY-ICON-*, MNU-*, CND-*, TYPE-WIN-*, TYPE-EDIT-WIN-01, TYPE-SW-WIN-01) are covered by Manual-Test-Protocol.md, not this harness; the merge never invents evidence for them."
  },
